  "deep_analysis": {
    "text": "Gold's bullish breakout alongside falling VIX and rising equities signals sustained risk appetite, pressuring the dollar across major pairs. Cross-asset momentum confirms the risk-on theme with Bitcoin advancing and copper gaining, though weaker oil caps commodity currency strength. The setup favors USDCAD and USDCHF shorts as USD weakness accelerates into European session. Today's BoE decision at 11:00 UTC and US retail sales at 12:30 UTC could amplify moves if they disappoint hawkish expectations or show continued consumer resilience respectively.",
